# 04. Canonical Entity Registry

AEGIS uses the following canonical entities.

## Core operational entities

```text
Observation
Signal
Anomaly
Event
Threat
RiskAssessment
Investigation
Case
Finding
TransmissionAssessment
ContainmentAction
ResponseAction
RecoveryAssessment
PreparednessLesson
ResilienceGap
ImprovementItem
ResearchFinding
```

## Supporting entities

```text
Location
Organization
Actor
Evidence
Notification
AuditRecord
DomainEvent
```

These are the canonical concepts.

Engineering may introduce implementation-level entities where necessary, but must not introduce competing business concepts without updating this document.

