---

# 23. Authorization

Authorization must be represented as an explicit concept where required.

Conceptual structure:

```text
Authorization
├── id
├── actionId
├── actor
├── authorityContext
├── decision
├── rationale
├── decidedAt
└── auditReference
```

Do not represent authorization merely as:

```text
approved: true
```

when a high-consequence action requires accountability.

