# 33. AuditRecord

AuditRecord is a non-negotiable component of AEGIS.

Conceptual structure:

```text
AuditRecord
├── id
├── actor
├── action
├── entityType
├── entityId
├── previousState
├── newState
├── reason
├── timestamp
├── source
└── metadata
```

Audit records must be append-oriented.

Historical operational truth must not be rewritten merely because the current state changed.

