openInvestigationCount
responseCompletionRate
currentRiskSummary
```

These can be calculated from authoritative data.

Do not persist derived values unless there is a deliberate reason.

---

# 83. Derived State Rule

If:

```text
X = function(A, B, C)
```

then avoid storing:

```text
X
A
B
C
