# 91. Master Data Integrity Rules

AEGIS data must satisfy these invariants.

## Invariant 01

Every persisted operational entity has a stable ID.

## Invariant 02

Every consequential state change is traceable.

## Invariant 03

Every assessment has an actor and time where required.

## Invariant 04

Historical state cannot be silently rewritten.

## Invariant 05

Evidence remains distinguishable from interpretation.

## Invariant 06

Unknown is not equivalent to false.

## Invariant 07

Unassessed is not equivalent to low risk.

## Invariant 08

Proposed is not equivalent to authorized.

## Invariant 09

Authorized is not equivalent to executed.

## Invariant 10

Executed is not equivalent to verified.

## Invariant 11

Current state must be reconstructable from authoritative data.

## Invariant 12

Derived data cannot silently become operational truth.

